## Proposed Architecture & Changes

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Rider as Rider App
    participant BullMQ as BullMQ / Scheduler
    participant Backend as Backend Service
    participant Cockpit as Captain Cockpit
    participant SchedTab as Captain Scheduled Tab

    Rider->>Backend: Schedule Ride (e.g., for 2:00 PM)
    Backend->>BullMQ: Enqueue `startMatching` with delay until T-15 min (1:45 PM)
    SchedTab->>Backend: View Scheduled Rides (Status: SCHEDULED)
    
    Note over BullMQ,Backend: At 1:45 PM (T-15 min)
    BullMQ->>Backend: Execute `startMatching` (Status -> SEARCHING)
    Backend->>Backend: Broadcast `ride:new` via Socket.IO to eligible captains
    
    par Cockpit Notification
        Backend->>Cockpit: Push `ride:new` or poll `/captains/active-request`
        Cockpit->>Cockpit: Auto-switch tab to Cockpit, display Accept/Reject card with countdown
    and Scheduled Tab Visibility
        SchedTab->>Backend: Fetch Scheduled Rides (Include SCHEDULED & SEARCHING)
        SchedTab->>SchedTab: Show "DISPATCHING NOW" badge with "Claim in Cockpit" CTA
    end

    alt Captain Accepts
        Cockpit->>Backend: POST /captains/rides/:id/accept
        Backend-->>Cockpit: Status -> CAPTAIN_ASSIGNED, show pickup navigation
    else Captain Declines / Ignores
        Cockpit->>Backend: POST /captains/rides/:id/reject
        Backend->>Backend: Record rejection, search next captain until pickup time
    end
```

